DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Numeric");

$fun_1 = Formula("ln(x)");
$fun_2 = Formula("sqrt(x)");
$fun_3 = Formula("ln(x)");
$fun_4 = Formula("ln(x)");
$fun_5 = Formula("x*4");
$fun_6 = Formula("sin(x)");

BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

Given this function:

[`[$fun_1]`]

Compute:
- [`f'(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_1->D()}

---

Given this function:

[`[$fun_2]`]

Compute:
- [`f'(8) =`] [_____]{$fun_2->D()->eval(x=>8)}
- [`f'(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_2->D()}
- [`f''(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_2->D()->D()}

---

Given this function:

[`[$fun_3]`]

Compute:
- [`f''(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_3->D()->D()}
- [`f''(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_3->D()->D()}

---

Given this function:

[`[$fun_4]`]

Compute:
- [`f'(5) =`] [_____]{$fun_4->D()->eval(x=>5)}
- [`f''(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_4->D()->D()}

---

Given this function:

[`[$fun_5]`]

Compute:
- [`f''(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_5->D()->D()}
- [`f'(6) =`] [_____]{$fun_5->D()->eval(x=>6)}
- [`f''(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_5->D()->D()}

---

Given this function:

[`[$fun_6]`]

Compute:
- [`f'(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_6->D()}

---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
